            "ch_10124/R18/10124B0_10124_Nml/10124B0_10124_002"
          ],
          "isEmpty": 0,
          "isCommentOut": 0
        },
        {
          "rowIndex": 14,
          "strings": [
            "",
            "",
            "主人公",
            "<Off>",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "えっ、ええ！？\n一緒に遊ぶって、僕はてっきり相撲だと……水着ないですよ？"
          ],
          "isEmpty": 0,
          "isCommentOut": 0
        },
        {
          "rowIndex": 15,
          "strings": [
            "",
            "",
            "シリコ",
            "<Off>",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
            "",
